# Caddyfile — copy this to your server repo root as ./Caddyfile
#
# App routing snippets from apps/*/*.caddy are rendered into the committed
# bundle .generated/caddy/apps.caddy by scaffold/docker/render-caddy-routes.sh.
# Injected into every site automatically: compression, JSON access logs with
# authenticated-user attribution, and baseline security headers (HSTS etc.;
# apps can override — the renderer uses set-if-absent).
